      "description": {
        "fun": "In legend it's the King of Bountiful Harvests, a merciful ruler of ancient Galar who could mend hearts and make plants spring forth. Its power comes from people's faith, so as they forgot it, it weakened, until now it can only talk to people by borrowing a human's body. Riding its old steed restores it. Its silhouette echoes the thistle, the emblem of Scotland, which the Crown Tundra is based on.",
        "guide": "A Psychic and Grass-type Legendary Pokémon and the mascot of The Crown Tundra. Using the Reins of Unity, Calyrex fuses with Glastrier or Spectrier to become Ice Rider or Shadow Rider Calyrex.",
